# 🎓 EduTrack — Student Management System

**A simple and interactive web application to manage student records, attendance, marks, fees, and academic performance.**

## 🌐 Live Demo
👉 https://anjanabejjanki07.github.io/EduTrack-Student-Management-System/

## ✨ Features
- 👨‍🎓 **Student Management** — Add, edit, delete, and search students.
- 📅 **Attendance Tracking** — Record and monitor attendance.
- 📊 **Academic Performance** — Manage marks and grades.
- 📚 **Course Management** — Organize courses and departments.
- 💰 **Fee Management** — Track student fees.
- 📈 **Reports** — Generate reports and export CSV files.
- 🌙 **Dark Mode** — Switch between light and dark themes.
- 💾 **Data Storage** — Save data using browser LocalStorage.

## 🛠️ Technologies Used
- **HTML5**
- **CSS3**
- **JavaScript**
- **LocalStorage**
- **GitHub Pages**

